    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Rush Trigger Styler is a powerful and flexible plugin that helps you create urgency and drive conversions on your WooCommerce store. With customizable rush triggers, you can display time-limited offers, countdown timers, and important announcements to your customers.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Customizable Styling:</strong> Completely customize the colors, text, and appearance of your rush trigger</li>\n<li><strong>Countdown Timer:</strong> Add a real-time countdown to create urgency</li>\n<li><strong>Flexible Positioning:</strong> Place your trigger at the top or bottom of your site</li>\n<li><strong>Animation Options:</strong> Choose from several animation styles</li>\n<li><strong>Page-specific Display:</strong> Control which pages show your rush trigger</li>\n<li><strong>Mobile Responsive:</strong> Looks great on all devices</li>\n<li><strong>WooCommerce Integration:</strong> Seamlessly works with your WooCommerce store</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the <code>rush-trigger-styler</code> folder to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress</li>\n<li>Go to WooCommerce &gt; Rush Trigger to configure your settings</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"can%20i%20display%20different%20triggers%20on%20different%20pages%3F\">\nCan I display different triggers on different pages?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Currently, the plugin displays the same trigger across all enabled pages. We&#8217;re working on adding page-specific triggers in a future update.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"does%20this%20work%20with%20any%20wordpress%20theme%3F\">\nDoes this work with any WordPress theme?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, Rush Trigger Styler is designed to work with any WordPress theme. The styling is self-contained and won&#8217;t conflict with your theme styles.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20i%20change%20the%20font%20or%20add%20custom%20css%3F\">\nCan I change the font or add custom CSS?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>The current version uses your theme&#8217;s default font. We plan to add custom font options and CSS capabilities in future updates.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Create and customize rush triggers with countdown timers and promotional messages for your WooCommerce store.",
    "description": "<p>Rush Trigger Styler is a powerful and flexible plugin that helps you create urgency and drive conversions on your WooCommerce store. With customizable rush triggers, you can display time-limited offers, countdown timers, and important announcements to your customers.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Customizable Styling:</strong> Completely customize the colors, text, and appearance of your rush trigger</li>\n<li><strong>Countdown Timer:</strong> Add a real-time countdown to create urgency</li>\n<li><strong>Flexible Positioning:</strong> Place your trigger at the top or bottom of your site</li>\n<li><strong>Animation Options:</strong> Choose from several animation styles</li>\n<li><strong>Page-specific Display:</strong> Control which pages show your rush trigger</li>\n<li><strong>Mobile Responsive:</strong> Looks great on all devices</li>\n<li><strong>WooCommerce Integration:</strong> Seamlessly works with your WooCommerce store</li>\n</ul>\n",
    "download_link": "https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/rush-trigger-styler.zip",
